{"id":"twitter:1672028368307384320","tweet_id":"1672028368307384320","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1672028368307384320","title":"@RobLXXIII @JerryBones8 @alwish1991 @stan423321 @John83778200 @RedDawnUkraine @Rodney91100 Peer Review, Bro Bilinsky, Y. (1999). Was the Ukrainian fam","summary":"@RobLXXIII @JerryBones8 @alwish1991 @stan423321 @John83778200 @RedDawnUkraine @Rodney91100 Peer Review, Bro Bilinsky, Y. (1999). Was the Ukrainian famine of 1932–1933 genocide?. Journal of Genocide Research, 1(2), 147-156. Marples, D. R. (2009). Ethnic Issues in the Famine of 1932–1933 in Ukraine. Europe-Asia Studies, 61(3), 505-518. https://t.co/6mF298KfJa","date":"2023-06-22","published":"2023-06-22T23:46:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RobLXXIII/status/1672027637751881728","reply_tweet_id":"1672027637751881728","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RobLXXIII @JerryBones8 @alwish1991 @stan423321 @John83778200 @RedDawnUkraine @Rodney91100 Peer Review, Bro<br><br>Bilinsky, Y. (1999). Was the Ukrainian famine of 1932–1933 genocide?. Journal of Genocide Research, 1(2), 147-156.<br><br>Marples, D. R. (2009). Ethnic Issues in the Famine of 1932–1933 in Ukraine. Europe-Asia Studies, 61(3), 505-518. <a href=\"https://t.co/6mF298KfJa\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/6mF298KfJa</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/98bd73455b732d748ce6346550d76a37.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1672028368307384320","display_date":"June 22, 2023 · 23:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/98bd73455b732d748ce6346550d76a37.jpg"]}
