{"id":"twitter:1668612403028697088","tweet_id":"1668612403028697088","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1668612403028697088","title":"@NUJofficial @NAFO_JayMac @myscotlandtoday Ian exclaims that Scotland Today is privately owned but there is no subscription model, no advertisement. W","summary":"@NUJofficial @NAFO_JayMac @myscotlandtoday Ian exclaims that Scotland Today is privately owned but there is no subscription model, no advertisement. Where does the funding come from? Transparency is a core requirement of Free Press. Otherwise you are left with state owned Gazetteers hiding behind \"free speech\"","date":"2023-06-13","published":"2023-06-13T13:32:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1668602997985669120","reply_tweet_id":"1668602997985669120","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@NUJofficial @NAFO_JayMac @myscotlandtoday Ian exclaims that Scotland Today is privately owned but there is no subscription model, no advertisement.<br><br>Where does the funding come from?<br><br>Transparency is a core requirement of Free Press.<br><br>Otherwise you are left with state owned Gazetteers hiding behind &quot;free speech&quot;</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1668612403028697088","display_date":"June 13, 2023 · 13:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
