{"id":"twitter:1666778036488794115","tweet_id":"1666778036488794115","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1666778036488794115","title":"@koneko @Mellowtopia @RusalkaNYC @trinzu_nafo @IamBohhi @SumakovaPolina Brainstorming isn't bad, don't beat yourself up. Having a list of trusted fund","summary":"@koneko @Mellowtopia @RusalkaNYC @trinzu_nafo @IamBohhi @SumakovaPolina Brainstorming isn't bad, don't beat yourself up. Having a list of trusted fundraisers is a great idea Just hard to do, think more about which one's will go on the donation sheet you give out at the art show You get to decide that, but feel free, make sure to ask others","date":"2023-06-08","published":"2023-06-08T12:03:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/koneko/status/1666777549924360192","reply_tweet_id":"1666777549924360192","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@koneko @Mellowtopia @RusalkaNYC @trinzu_nafo @IamBohhi @SumakovaPolina Brainstorming isn&#x27;t bad, don&#x27;t beat yourself up.<br><br>Having a list of trusted fundraisers is a great idea<br><br>Just hard to do, think more about which one&#x27;s will go on the donation sheet you give out at the art show<br><br>You get to decide that, but feel free, make sure to ask others</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1666778036488794115","display_date":"June 08, 2023 · 12:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
