{"id":"twitter:1666465290060812288","tweet_id":"1666465290060812288","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1666465290060812288","title":"@john_sipher @Kama_Kamilia weird how many people in call funded Locals, the Rumble crowd funding tool. Weird how Rumble is the third largest linker to","summary":"@john_sipher @Kama_Kamilia weird how many people in call funded Locals, the Rumble crowd funding tool. Weird how Rumble is the third largest linker to Russian State Media in the world Weird how some shows on Rumble produced by media houses under Sanction. Weird how Elon plans to integrate Rumble https://t.co/bzL4PyQjBN","date":"2023-06-07","published":"2023-06-07T15:21:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1666459652056285184","reply_tweet_id":"1666459652056285184","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@john_sipher @Kama_Kamilia weird how many people in call funded Locals, the Rumble crowd funding tool.<br><br>Weird how Rumble is  the third largest linker to Russian State Media in the world<br><br>Weird how some shows on Rumble produced by media houses under Sanction.<br><br>Weird how Elon plans to integrate Rumble <a href=\"https://t.co/bzL4PyQjBN\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/bzL4PyQjBN</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/ea9fd6f7cbc05f62bf0bf20f03f039e7.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1666465290060812288","display_date":"June 07, 2023 · 15:21 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/ea9fd6f7cbc05f62bf0bf20f03f039e7.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1666464190490345472","tweet_id":"1666464190490345472","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1666464190490345472","title":"@Nuada508 @fatcatdrummer @MMTLabour @SocialistMMA @UnholyRom3 Are you willing to learn how the war was always Russia and the entire idea of Ukrainians","summary":"@Nuada508 @fatcatdrummer @MMTLabour @SocialistMMA @UnholyRom3 Are you willing to learn how the war was always Russia and the entire idea of Ukrainians shelling Ukrainians in an eight year civil war is a lie? https://t.co/gJ9b4eHXM7","date":"2023-06-07","published":"2023-06-07T15:16:39+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Nuada508/status/1666459916096135168","reply_tweet_id":"1666459916096135168","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Nuada508 @fatcatdrummer @MMTLabour @SocialistMMA @UnholyRom3 Are you willing to learn how the war was always Russia and the entire idea of Ukrainians shelling Ukrainians in an eight year civil war is a lie? <a href=\"https://t.co/gJ9b4eHXM7\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/gJ9b4eHXM7</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f6819bef7daeac3c16ff8a315a8a71b6.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1666464190490345472","display_date":"June 07, 2023 · 15:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f6819bef7daeac3c16ff8a315a8a71b6.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1666463824466042883","tweet_id":"1666463824466042883","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1666463824466042883","title":"Now torrents of misery wrought by monsters as immovable walls reflect an evil so deep Gentle sloping fields used to sing to wide valleys songs carried","summary":"Now torrents of misery wrought by monsters as immovable walls reflect an evil so deep Gentle sloping fields used to sing to wide valleys songs carried by Greylong Geese til sun fades on whistles of Night Herons Now voices washed away but our soul still flies #smallpoems #NAFO","date":"2023-06-07","published":"2023-06-07T15:15:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1666462412415856640","reply_tweet_id":"1666462412415856640","tags":["smallpoems","NAFO"],"body_html":"<p>Now torrents of misery<br>wrought by monsters<br>as immovable walls<br> reflect an evil <br>so deep<br><br>Gentle sloping fields<br>used to sing to wide valleys<br>songs carried by Greylong Geese til<br>sun fades on whistles of Night Herons<br>Now voices washed <br>away<br>but our<br>soul still flies<br>#smallpoems<br>#NAFO</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1666463824466042883","display_date":"June 07, 2023 · 15:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1666462412415856640","tweet_id":"1666462412415856640","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1666462412415856640","title":"On shores of ancient rivers, rise banks of humanity now swallowed Bosmina once gatheres at Barriers of Barbaric Design Scars thrice ripped open Ancien","summary":"On shores of ancient rivers, rise banks of humanity now swallowed Bosmina once gatheres at Barriers of Barbaric Design Scars thrice ripped open Ancient trails extolled by Stabo and paths transversed by Pliny the Younger Gone #smallpoems #NAFO 1/2","date":"2023-06-07","published":"2023-06-07T15:09:35+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems","NAFO"],"body_html":"<p>On shores<br> of ancient<br>rivers, rise<br>banks<br> of humanity<br>now swallowed<br>Bosmina once gatheres<br>at Barriers of Barbaric<br>Design<br>Scars thrice<br> ripped open<br>Ancient trails<br> extolled by Stabo<br>and paths transversed<br> by Pliny the Younger<br>Gone<br>#smallpoems<br>#NAFO <br>1/2</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1666462412415856640","display_date":"June 07, 2023 · 15:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
