{"id":"twitter:1666413448870207488","tweet_id":"1666413448870207488","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1666413448870207488","title":"@Coda_RA @JtBagleyy You know what's weird. Out of all the people who seem to hate Russia the most it is Russian's from Russia. Literally out of everyo","summary":"@Coda_RA @JtBagleyy You know what's weird. Out of all the people who seem to hate Russia the most it is Russian's from Russia. Literally out of everyone I know nobody wants to see Russia burn more than Russians. And I know a ton Ukrainians. Russians from Russia still hate Russia more https://t.co/sOUecQY5rr","date":"2023-06-07","published":"2023-06-07T11:55:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Coda_RA/status/1663885148465553409","reply_tweet_id":"1663885148465553409","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Coda_RA @JtBagleyy You know what&#x27;s weird.<br><br>Out of all the people who seem to hate Russia the most it is Russian&#x27;s from Russia.<br><br>Literally out of everyone I know nobody wants to see Russia burn more than Russians.<br><br>And I know a ton  Ukrainians. Russians from Russia still hate Russia more <a href=\"https://t.co/sOUecQY5rr\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/sOUecQY5rr</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/614d06f17b45e983b7c067d38f913f9e.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1666413448870207488","display_date":"June 07, 2023 · 11:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/614d06f17b45e983b7c067d38f913f9e.jpg"]}
