{"id":"twitter:1664451454092886022","tweet_id":"1664451454092886022","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1664451454092886022","title":"@fellarific @PatriotKisses @NAFO_Marvin @BruinGOP @UCLA Here is the link to the Executive Order: https://obamawhitehouse.archives.gov/the-press-office","summary":"@fellarific @PatriotKisses @NAFO_Marvin @BruinGOP @UCLA Here is the link to the Executive Order: https://obamawhitehouse.archives.gov/the-press-office/2011/07/25/executive-order-13581-blocking-property-transnational-criminal-organizat By continuously looking for a new vendor after knowing of a possible violation Jackson engaged in conspiracy to violate the p","date":"2023-06-02","published":"2023-06-02T01:58:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1664450013823369219","reply_tweet_id":"1664450013823369219","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@fellarific @PatriotKisses @NAFO_Marvin @BruinGOP @UCLA Here is the link to the Executive Order: <a href=\"https://obamawhitehouse.archives.gov/the-press-office/2011/07/25/executive-order-13581-blocking-property-transnational-criminal-organizat\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://obamawhitehouse.archives.gov/the-press-office/2011/07/25/executive-order-13581-blocking-property-transnational-criminal-organizat</a><br><br>By continuously looking for a new vendor after knowing of a possible violation Jackson engaged in conspiracy to violate  the prohibitions set forth in the EO.<br><br>That is bad, bad</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1664451454092886022","display_date":"June 02, 2023 · 01:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1664450013823369219","tweet_id":"1664450013823369219","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1664450013823369219","title":"@fellarific @PatriotKisses @NAFO_Marvin @BruinGOP If you are student or faculty @ucla use the Ombuds office. If you outside the University system and ","summary":"@fellarific @PatriotKisses @NAFO_Marvin @BruinGOP If you are student or faculty @ucla use the Ombuds office. If you outside the University system and want to ask if having someone who sells swag for PMC Wagner is a violation of Executive Order EO 13581 use this link: https://compliance.ucla.edu/report-a-concern","date":"2023-06-02","published":"2023-06-02T01:53:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1664449330210537475","reply_tweet_id":"1664449330210537475","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@fellarific @PatriotKisses @NAFO_Marvin @BruinGOP If you are student or faculty @ucla use the Ombuds office.<br><br>If you outside the University system and  want to ask if having someone who sells swag for PMC Wagner is a violation of Executive Order EO 13581 use this link: <a href=\"https://compliance.ucla.edu/report-a-concern\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://compliance.ucla.edu/report-a-concern</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1664450013823369219","display_date":"June 02, 2023 · 01:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1664449330210537475","tweet_id":"1664449330210537475","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1664449330210537475","title":"@fellarific @PatriotKisses @NAFO_Marvin @BruinGOP quote from his show. important to note PMC Wagner is sanctioned under EO 13581. Further after people","summary":"@fellarific @PatriotKisses @NAFO_Marvin @BruinGOP quote from his show. important to note PMC Wagner is sanctioned under EO 13581. Further after people let Jackson know swelling swag may violate EO 13581. he launched a campaign to get around those sanctions. A massive campaign demonstrates intent https://compliance.ucla.edu/report-a-concern https://t.co/sNEQZ","date":"2023-06-02","published":"2023-06-02T01:50:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/fellarific/status/1664447539695980544","reply_tweet_id":"1664447539695980544","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@fellarific @PatriotKisses @NAFO_Marvin @BruinGOP quote from his show.<br><br>important to note PMC Wagner is sanctioned under EO 13581.<br><br>Further after people let Jackson know swelling swag may violate EO 13581. he launched a campaign to get around those sanctions.<br><br>A massive campaign demonstrates intent<br><br><a href=\"https://compliance.ucla.edu/report-a-concern\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://compliance.ucla.edu/report-a-concern</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/sNEQZpFikW\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/sNEQZpFikW</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/8c687fe79ca4a0c2d2cb4783763f4935.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1664449330210537475","display_date":"June 02, 2023 · 01:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/8c687fe79ca4a0c2d2cb4783763f4935.jpg"]}
