{"id":"twitter:1664393245105836032","tweet_id":"1664393245105836032","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1664393245105836032","title":"@CKikila @BruinGOP @UCLA Here is a quote. Your issue @BruinGOP is not one of Free Speech. This is a clear sanction violation as spelled out in Executi","summary":"@CKikila @BruinGOP @UCLA Here is a quote. Your issue @BruinGOP is not one of Free Speech. This is a clear sanction violation as spelled out in Executive Order (E.O.) 13581, as amended by E.O. 13863. We don't see how @ucla can host this event. Hinkle uses his speaking engagements for Wagner benefit https://t.co/Wo14W9AGkj","date":"2023-06-01","published":"2023-06-01T22:07:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1664390341414334464","reply_tweet_id":"1664390341414334464","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@CKikila @BruinGOP @UCLA Here is a quote.<br><br>Your issue @BruinGOP is not one of Free Speech.<br><br>This is a clear sanction violation as spelled out in  Executive Order (E.O.) 13581, as amended by E.O. 13863.<br><br>We don&#x27;t see how @ucla can host this event.<br><br>Hinkle  uses his speaking engagements for Wagner benefit <a href=\"https://t.co/Wo14W9AGkj\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/Wo14W9AGkj</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/34f237bb93cea112902d5bdce83aa341.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/d324d86be51a66b4553e9aeca268e45e.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1664393245105836032","display_date":"June 01, 2023 · 22:07 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/34f237bb93cea112902d5bdce83aa341.jpg","/archive/twitter/media/d324d86be51a66b4553e9aeca268e45e.jpg"]}
