{"id":"twitter:1664024799016779776","tweet_id":"1664024799016779776","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1664024799016779776","title":"@karel_bellic @crypto_nx @OlgaBazova @e_l_g_c_a I am willing to be your Huckleberry. My working theory is Russia made neoNazis on all sides as well as","summary":"@karel_bellic @crypto_nx @OlgaBazova @e_l_g_c_a I am willing to be your Huckleberry. My working theory is Russia made neoNazis on all sides as well as reaction those right wing radicals on all side. Especially since 2015. And even if there were a couple neonazis or other farright units it does not excuse flattening Donbas https://t.co/KSLZS7G5Ii","date":"2023-05-31","published":"2023-05-31T21:43:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/karel_bellic/status/1664022464794447872","reply_tweet_id":"1664022464794447872","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@karel_bellic @crypto_nx @OlgaBazova @e_l_g_c_a I am willing to be your Huckleberry.<br><br>My working theory is Russia made neoNazis on all sides as well as reaction those right wing radicals on all side.<br><br>Especially since 2015.<br><br>And even if there were a couple neonazis or other farright units it does not excuse flattening Donbas <a href=\"https://t.co/KSLZS7G5Ii\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/KSLZS7G5Ii</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/0e58d1bd4b72addfe78ed9632e65fe9c.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1664024799016779776","display_date":"May 31, 2023 · 21:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/0e58d1bd4b72addfe78ed9632e65fe9c.jpg"]}
