{"id":"twitter:1663980022313435139","tweet_id":"1663980022313435139","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1663980022313435139","title":"@ne_vluchiv Yes that is the problem, and mine all broke, I don't know if the scripts will still run, put the \"cyrilic\" keywoerds in B9, hit run and se","summary":"@ne_vluchiv Yes that is the problem, and mine all broke, I don't know if the scripts will still run, put the \"cyrilic\" keywoerds in B9, hit run and see what happens. Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn't. Supposed to be shutdown, but sometimes still works.","date":"2023-05-31","published":"2023-05-31T18:45:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ne_vluchiv/status/1663979563402051594","reply_tweet_id":"1663979563402051594","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ne_vluchiv Yes that is the problem, and mine all broke, I don&#x27;t know if the scripts will still run,<br><br>put the &quot;cyrilic&quot; keywoerds in B9, hit run and see what happens.<br><br>Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn&#x27;t.<br><br>Supposed to be shutdown, but sometimes still works.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663980022313435139","display_date":"May 31, 2023 · 18:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
