{"id":"twitter:1663945438339166209","tweet_id":"1663945438339166209","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1663945438339166209","title":"When first flower blossoms begin to fall, petals caught in a wind, you hear the dog's howl songs for Galia spilled in pages of tears Notes who soak in","summary":"When first flower blossoms begin to fall, petals caught in a wind, you hear the dog's howl songs for Galia spilled in pages of tears Notes who soak into soul so our beloveds can frolick again #smallpoems","date":"2023-05-31","published":"2023-05-31T16:28:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>When<br>  first <br>flower blossoms<br>begin to fall,<br>petals caught <br>in a <br>wind,<br>you hear the dog&#x27;s<br>howl<br>  songs<br>  for<br>Galia spilled<br> in pages of<br>tears<br> Notes who soak<br>into  soul<br>so our beloveds<br>can frolick again<br>#smallpoems</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663945438339166209","display_date":"May 31, 2023 · 16:28 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
