{"id":"twitter:1663310867213975552","tweet_id":"1663310867213975552","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1663310867213975552","title":"@handles78892211 @MrBiswaz @guffynicola @WasnWrong @BarbatoSalv @shaunmwing @Sir_Yours_Truly One day I will finish this audio essay. Almost up to my f","summary":"@handles78892211 @MrBiswaz @guffynicola @WasnWrong @BarbatoSalv @shaunmwing @Sir_Yours_Truly One day I will finish this audio essay. Almost up to my favorite jazz bass players: https://longthoughts.jgregorymcverry.com/doku.php?id=musichour&s[]=bass Ron Carter Stanley Clarke Jaco Pastorius Ezperenza Spalding With Crazy Jaco leading the pack (and a GOAT conten","date":"2023-05-29","published":"2023-05-29T22:26:28+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663310239045697536","reply_tweet_id":"1663310239045697536","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@handles78892211 @MrBiswaz @guffynicola @WasnWrong @BarbatoSalv @shaunmwing @Sir_Yours_Truly One day I will finish this audio essay. Almost up to my favorite jazz bass players: <br><br><a href=\"https://longthoughts.jgregorymcverry.com/doku.php?id=musichour&amp;s[]=bass\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://longthoughts.jgregorymcverry.com/doku.php?id=musichour&amp;s[]=bass</a><br><br>Ron Carter<br>Stanley Clarke<br>Jaco Pastorius<br>Ezperenza Spalding<br><br>With Crazy Jaco leading the pack (and a GOAT contender) <br><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TgntkGc5iBo\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TgntkGc5iBo</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663310867213975552","display_date":"May 29, 2023 · 22:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1663310239045697536","tweet_id":"1663310239045697536","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1663310239045697536","title":"@handles78892211 @MrBiswaz @guffynicola @WasnWrong @BarbatoSalv @shaunmwing @Sir_Yours_Truly We booked Jon Scofield and Medeski, Martin, and Wood to p","summary":"@handles78892211 @MrBiswaz @guffynicola @WasnWrong @BarbatoSalv @shaunmwing @Sir_Yours_Truly We booked Jon Scofield and Medeski, Martin, and Wood to play a gig way back in the day. I also did a show six people came to (my six friends) that had Gordon Stone Trio doing an acoustic followed by the Disco Biscuits.","date":"2023-05-29","published":"2023-05-29T22:23:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/handles78892211/status/1662872701088722952","reply_tweet_id":"1662872701088722952","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@handles78892211 @MrBiswaz @guffynicola @WasnWrong @BarbatoSalv @shaunmwing @Sir_Yours_Truly We  booked Jon Scofield and Medeski, Martin, and Wood to play a gig way back in the day. <br><br>I also did a show six people came to (my six friends) that had Gordon Stone Trio doing an acoustic followed by the Disco Biscuits.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663310239045697536","display_date":"May 29, 2023 · 22:23 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
