{"id":"twitter:1663262253007659010","tweet_id":"1663262253007659010","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1663262253007659010","title":"yet fated in concrete seal nothing more than a rabid dog descending on Human nakedness too diseased to see their demise as our only cure. #smallpoems ","summary":"yet fated in concrete seal nothing more than a rabid dog descending on Human nakedness too diseased to see their demise as our only cure. #smallpoems 3/3","date":"2023-05-29","published":"2023-05-29T19:13:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663262064574361602","reply_tweet_id":"1663262064574361602","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>yet fated <br>    in concrete<br>seal<br>nothing<br>   more<br>than a rabid<br>dog descending on <br>Human nakedness<br>too diseased to see their<br>demise<br>as our only<br>cure.<br><br>#smallpoems<br>3/3</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663262253007659010","display_date":"May 29, 2023 · 19:13 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1663262064574361602","tweet_id":"1663262064574361602","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1663262064574361602","title":"For evil only begins when one grasps a weighted folly nature, God, and self part and parcel to a lost essence in Hegel's Waiting Room hoping to hold T","summary":"For evil only begins when one grasps a weighted folly nature, God, and self part and parcel to a lost essence in Hegel's Waiting Room hoping to hold THE Rose in place #smallpoems 2/3 (oops)","date":"2023-05-29","published":"2023-05-29T19:12:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663260768224043008","reply_tweet_id":"1663260768224043008","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>For evil<br> only begins<br>when one<br>grasps<br> a weighted folly<br>nature, God, and<br>self part and parcel<br>to a lost essence<br>in Hegel&#x27;s Waiting Room<br>hoping to hold THE Rose in<br>place<br>#smallpoems<br>2/3<br>(oops)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663262064574361602","display_date":"May 29, 2023 · 19:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1663260768224043008","tweet_id":"1663260768224043008","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1663260768224043008","title":"In cosmic knowledge politics means anything but a forgiven sin as laws of ascent do not descend from a March on Rome. Nor slip off lips of technologis","summary":"In cosmic knowledge politics means anything but a forgiven sin as laws of ascent do not descend from a March on Rome. Nor slip off lips of technologists tweaking words at world's abyss Divine does not sink on an empirical existence #smallpoems 1/2","date":"2023-05-29","published":"2023-05-29T19:07:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>In cosmic knowledge<br>  politics<br>means anything<br>but a forgiven<br> sin as<br>laws of<br> ascent<br>do not descend<br> from a March on<br>Rome.<br><br>Nor slip off lips<br>of technologists<br>tweaking  words<br>at world&#x27;s abyss<br>Divine does not sink<br>on an <br> empirical existence<br>#smallpoems<br>1/2</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663260768224043008","display_date":"May 29, 2023 · 19:07 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
