{"id":"twitter:1663177220565630976","tweet_id":"1663177220565630976","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1663177220565630976","title":"Hey #NAFO fella be careful purchasing swag Make sure you are using a trusted store. #NAFO has one and many trusted forgers and artists have various ch","summary":"Hey #NAFO fella be careful purchasing swag Make sure you are using a trusted store. #NAFO has one and many trusted forgers and artists have various channels but all the profits go to charity. Many tshirt companies co-opt NAFO designs. Always doubt. When in doubt, ask. https://x.com/wearorastore/status/1663116016241475585","date":"2023-05-29","published":"2023-05-29T13:35:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["NAFO","NAFO"],"body_html":"<p>Hey #NAFO fella be careful purchasing swag<br><br>Make sure you are using a trusted store. #NAFO has one and many trusted forgers and artists have various channels<br><br>but all the profits go to charity. Many tshirt companies co-opt NAFO designs.<br><br>Always doubt. When in doubt, ask. <a href=\"https://x.com/wearorastore/status/1663116016241475585\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/wearorastore/status/1663116016241475585</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663177220565630976","display_date":"May 29, 2023 · 13:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
