{"id":"twitter:1663152035531833344","tweet_id":"1663152035531833344","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1663152035531833344","title":"@Atamansikka @Mikk15795488 Red lines in Syria were ignored when people still thought the S-400 actually worked. You can't hit criminals with sanctions","summary":"@Atamansikka @Mikk15795488 Red lines in Syria were ignored when people still thought the S-400 actually worked. You can't hit criminals with sanctions when they spent a decade stockpiling reserves America was tired of war too. but this dude is 100% incorrect. Russia started this war","date":"2023-05-29","published":"2023-05-29T11:55:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Atamansikka/status/1663132164496433153","reply_tweet_id":"1663132164496433153","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Atamansikka @Mikk15795488 Red lines in Syria were ignored when people still thought the S-400 actually worked.<br><br>You can&#x27;t hit criminals with sanctions when they spent a decade stockpiling reserves<br><br>America was tired of war too.<br><br>but this dude is 100% incorrect.<br><br>Russia started this war</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663152035531833344","display_date":"May 29, 2023 · 11:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
