{"id":"twitter:1663148683033034754","tweet_id":"1663148683033034754","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1663148683033034754","title":"People often ask Why no Big Parades No tanks, guns, and planes But flags do wave flowers lain upon graves Yet these weapons of thanks carry grace in h","summary":"People often ask Why no Big Parades No tanks, guns, and planes But flags do wave flowers lain upon graves Yet these weapons of thanks carry grace in hands of babes on every Main Street in every town Silent rounds bowed in Thanks Not Declarations of the State #smallpoems https://t.co/FmAPIN1cO6","date":"2023-05-29","published":"2023-05-29T11:42:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>People often ask <br>Why no Big Parades<br>No tanks, guns, and planes<br>But flags do wave<br>flowers lain upon graves<br>Yet these weapons of thanks<br>carry grace<br>in hands of babes<br> on every Main Street<br>in every town<br>Silent rounds bowed<br>in Thanks<br>Not Declarations of the<br> State<br>#smallpoems <a href=\"https://t.co/FmAPIN1cO6\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/FmAPIN1cO6</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/dda8e3626d81409d8e6b04bbf0126394.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1663148683033034754","display_date":"May 29, 2023 · 11:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/dda8e3626d81409d8e6b04bbf0126394.jpg"]}
