{"id":"twitter:1662591299017404416","tweet_id":"1662591299017404416","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1662591299017404416","title":"This is an important point. Find what you want to do or how you want to grow and find ways to align this to mission and vision. No one way to do anyth","summary":"This is an important point. Find what you want to do or how you want to grow and find ways to align this to mission and vision. No one way to do anything in the rainbow of thought we call NAFO. https://x.com/Crispyliver/status/1662586978783870976","date":"2023-05-27","published":"2023-05-27T22:47:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>This is an important point.<br><br>Find what you want to do or how you want to grow and find ways to align this to mission and vision.<br><br>No one way to do anything in the rainbow of thought we call NAFO. <a href=\"https://x.com/Crispyliver/status/1662586978783870976\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/Crispyliver/status/1662586978783870976</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1662591299017404416","display_date":"May 27, 2023 · 22:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1662590981995200512","tweet_id":"1662590981995200512","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1662590981995200512","title":"@Crispyliver @Phil_Darin Agree 100 ways to NAFO, and I was using bonk for a double etendre. Didn't mean to suggest one way to NAFO. If you can find be","summary":"@Crispyliver @Phil_Darin Agree 100 ways to NAFO, and I was using bonk for a double etendre. Didn't mean to suggest one way to NAFO. If you can find better ways to do NAFO, fuck it. I also find it silly to watch heisenberg principle unfold without people seeing the dangle of the angle in the algo","date":"2023-05-27","published":"2023-05-27T22:45:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Crispyliver/status/1662586978783870976","reply_tweet_id":"1662586978783870976","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Crispyliver @Phil_Darin Agree 100 ways to NAFO, and I was using bonk for a double etendre.<br><br>Didn&#x27;t mean to suggest one way to NAFO.<br><br>If you can find better ways to do NAFO, fuck it.<br><br>I also find it silly to watch heisenberg principle unfold without people seeing the dangle of the angle in the algo</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1662590981995200512","display_date":"May 27, 2023 · 22:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
