{"id":"twitter:1661705173532647424","tweet_id":"1661705173532647424","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1661705173532647424","title":"@romankulish @sleeping_kali @exileoftza @OpenMatt @wordpressdotcom @automattic @tumblr @supernovia @WordPress These are usually other vendors using Op","summary":"@romankulish @sleeping_kali @exileoftza @OpenMatt @wordpressdotcom @automattic @tumblr @supernovia @WordPress These are usually other vendors using Open Source @WordPress in managed low and moderate environments but managed VIP through @wordpressdotcom still huge in US Federal. Proubably big across State, Local, and Education (SLED) too.","date":"2023-05-25","published":"2023-05-25T12:06:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1661704601316237312","reply_tweet_id":"1661704601316237312","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@romankulish @sleeping_kali @exileoftza @OpenMatt @wordpressdotcom @automattic @tumblr @supernovia @WordPress These are usually other vendors using Open Source @WordPress in managed low and moderate environments but managed VIP through @wordpressdotcom still huge in US Federal. Proubably big across State, Local, and Education (SLED) too.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1661705173532647424","display_date":"May 25, 2023 · 12:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1661704601316237312","tweet_id":"1661704601316237312","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1661704601316237312","title":"@romankulish @sleeping_kali @exileoftza @OpenMatt @wordpressdotcom @automattic @tumblr @supernovia Ahh you do IT. Fun fact @WordPress (last I checked)","summary":"@romankulish @sleeping_kali @exileoftza @OpenMatt @wordpressdotcom @automattic @tumblr @supernovia Ahh you do IT. Fun fact @WordPress (last I checked) is fastest growing FedRAMP (US Government required cloud vendor certification) vendor for first tier of requirements (FedRAMP-Low) Not same thing as @wordpressdotcom but WordPress VIP does ton of biz. prolly s","date":"2023-05-25","published":"2023-05-25T12:03:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/romankulish/status/1661590279827382272","reply_tweet_id":"1661590279827382272","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@romankulish @sleeping_kali @exileoftza @OpenMatt @wordpressdotcom @automattic @tumblr @supernovia Ahh you do IT.<br><br>Fun fact @WordPress (last I checked) is  fastest growing FedRAMP (US Government required cloud vendor certification) vendor for first tier of requirements (FedRAMP-Low)<br><br>Not same thing as @wordpressdotcom but WordPress VIP does ton of biz. prolly same in Aus</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1661704601316237312","display_date":"May 25, 2023 · 12:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
