{"id":"twitter:1661432352453607426","tweet_id":"1661432352453607426","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1661432352453607426","title":"and when cast and crew pooled amongst fools Crazy Eights in 14 words bound to happen and the children cry By the third act relevance done and now the ","summary":"and when cast and crew pooled amongst fools Crazy Eights in 14 words bound to happen and the children cry By the third act relevance done and now the gun points at you (and the children smile) 3/3 #smallpoems","date":"2023-05-24","published":"2023-05-24T18:01:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1661431114748100619","reply_tweet_id":"1661431114748100619","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>and when cast and crew<br>pooled amongst fools<br>Crazy Eights  in<br>14 words bound to<br>happen<br>and the<br>children<br>cry<br><br>By the third<br>act<br>relevance done<br>and now the gun<br>points at you<br>(and the<br>children<br>smile)<br><br>3/3<br>#smallpoems</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1661432352453607426","display_date":"May 24, 2023 · 18:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
