{"id":"twitter:1660679899571535873","tweet_id":"1660679899571535873","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1660679899571535873","title":"I don't get it. @rumblevideo is basically a tool that allows so many Russian television channels and production companies to skirt sanctions. Company ","summary":"I don't get it. @rumblevideo is basically a tool that allows so many Russian television channels and production companies to skirt sanctions. Company is HQ in Toronto and US. Does Section 230 cover sanction violations in US? Who knows the Canadian Law? https://t.co/wYpXWoaXxY","date":"2023-05-22","published":"2023-05-22T16:11:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I don&#x27;t get it. @rumblevideo is basically a tool that allows so many Russian television channels and production companies to skirt sanctions.<br><br>Company is HQ in Toronto and US. <br><br>Does Section 230 cover sanction violations in US?<br><br>Who knows the Canadian Law? <a href=\"https://t.co/wYpXWoaXxY\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/wYpXWoaXxY</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/46e83717ac60e1a3c002da2ce9b8c212.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/aee99fa5c1b6a4931ee4dc07bf688f9c.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/43fd48702de8e282c327b963ad3f4d2c.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/4c7d7065c9c6b1b30f099ad0e50fd2e5.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1660679899571535873","display_date":"May 22, 2023 · 16:11 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/46e83717ac60e1a3c002da2ce9b8c212.jpg","/archive/twitter/media/aee99fa5c1b6a