{"id":"twitter:1660441649804111885","tweet_id":"1660441649804111885","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1660441649804111885","title":"hierarchy of capacities demand principle and laws of social organization concentrated inequalities among men as a fact of nature only harshness of a p","summary":"hierarchy of capacities demand principle and laws of social organization concentrated inequalities among men as a fact of nature only harshness of a peasant's struggle with nature can happiness be found in miseries of solidarity Make it Great, a time before #smallpoems","date":"2023-05-22","published":"2023-05-22T00:25:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>hierarchy of capacities<br>demand<br>principle and laws<br>of<br>social organization<br>concentrated<br> inequalities among men <br>as a fact<br> of nature<br>only<br>harshness of  a peasant&#x27;s<br> struggle with nature<br>can happiness be found<br>in miseries of solidarity<br>Make it Great, a time<br>before<br>#smallpoems</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1660441649804111885","display_date":"May 22, 2023 · 00:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1660439795309395969","tweet_id":"1660439795309395969","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1660439795309395969","title":"on the farm all pigs are equal as all classes toil clocks clicking to noises of sunrise earth is our fertility and makes fruit ripen while vines of mo","summary":"on the farm all pigs are equal as all classes toil clocks clicking to noises of sunrise earth is our fertility and makes fruit ripen while vines of modern producers no longer, as in the fields, a sovereign and free father of a family, no alphas in Modern Family #smallpoems","date":"2023-05-22","published":"2023-05-22T00:17:51+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>on the farm<br>all pigs<br>are equal<br> as all classes<br>toil <br>clocks<br> clicking <br>to noises<br>of sunrise<br>earth is our<br>fertility<br>and makes fruit<br>ripen while<br>vines of modern<br>producers<br>no longer, as in the fields,<br>a sovereign and free father of a family, no alphas<br>in Modern Family<br>#smallpoems</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1660439795309395969","display_date":"May 22, 2023 · 00:17 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
