{"id":"twitter:1660422230281428993","tweet_id":"1660422230281428993","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1660422230281428993","title":"Post modern fools with tools of deconstruction requires thrusts at corrections in desire Nihilistic critical stances and who knows whats in their pant","summary":"Post modern fools with tools of deconstruction requires thrusts at corrections in desire Nihilistic critical stances and who knows whats in their pantses bind our time and place to chronotope prisons seen through western forced prisms shatter other worldings #smallpoems","date":"2023-05-21","published":"2023-05-21T23:08:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>Post modern<br>  fools<br>  with tools<br>of deconstruction<br>requires<br>thrusts at<br>corrections <br> in desire Nihilistic <br> critical stances and who knows<br> whats in their pantses<br> bind our time and place<br>to chronotope<br>prisons seen through<br>western forced<br>prisms shatter other<br>worldings<br>#smallpoems</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1660422230281428993","display_date":"May 21, 2023 · 23:08 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1660420083976396802","tweet_id":"1660420083976396802","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1660420083976396802","title":"Discourses of interpretivism cast modernity as an approching calamity, an evil cast in light, and must save us from instrumental rationality in praxis","summary":"Discourses of interpretivism cast modernity as an approching calamity, an evil cast in light, and must save us from instrumental rationality in praxis of truth lost in consensus of continuous redefining realities around me #smallpoems","date":"2023-05-21","published":"2023-05-21T22:59:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["smallpoems"],"body_html":"<p>Discourses<br> of interpretivism<br>cast modernity<br>as an approching<br> calamity, an evil<br>cast in light, and<br>must save us from<br>  instrumental <br>rationality<br> in praxis <br>of truth<br> lost in <br>consensus<br>of continuous<br>redefining <br>realities<br>around me<br>#smallpoems</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1660420083976396802","display_date":"May 21, 2023 · 22:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
