{"id":"twitter:1660386559122702336","tweet_id":"1660386559122702336","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1660386559122702336","title":"@ndboulton @yurapalyanytsia @Justadutchguy @Official_NAFO My experience with people pointing me to reliable sources doesn't reflect this statement at ","summary":"@ndboulton @yurapalyanytsia @Justadutchguy @Official_NAFO My experience with people pointing me to reliable sources doesn't reflect this statement at all. Come Back Alive is listed. Let us remember you complaint is...it took too long to get CBA listed Not that it isn't listed. You should pivot and point people to CBA through #NAFO","date":"2023-05-21","published":"2023-05-21T20:46:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ndboulton/status/1660367618153349120","reply_tweet_id":"1660367618153349120","tags":["NAFO"],"body_html":"<p>@ndboulton @yurapalyanytsia @Justadutchguy @Official_NAFO My experience with people pointing me to reliable sources doesn&#x27;t reflect this statement at all.<br><br>Come Back Alive is listed.<br><br>Let us remember you complaint is...it took too long to get CBA listed<br><br>Not that it isn&#x27;t listed.<br><br>You should pivot and point people to CBA through #NAFO</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1660386559122702336","display_date":"May 21, 2023 · 20:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1660385943834984451","tweet_id":"1660385943834984451","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1660385943834984451","title":"@ndboulton @yurapalyanytsia @Justadutchguy @Official_NAFO I see it as a place where the endeavor itself is the goal and leadership is both porous and ","summary":"@ndboulton @yurapalyanytsia @Justadutchguy @Official_NAFO I see it as a place where the endeavor itself is the goal and leadership is both porous and a resource. and since dogs have no pores it is a lot of slobber all over the forge. People organize fundraisers on and off anything official. all that matters","date":"2023-05-21","published":"2023-05-21T20:43:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ndboulton/status/1660366162067087361","reply_tweet_id":"1660366162067087361","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ndboulton @yurapalyanytsia @Justadutchguy @Official_NAFO I see it as a place where the endeavor itself is the goal  and leadership is both porous and a resource.<br><br>and since dogs have no pores it is a lot of slobber all over the forge.<br><br>People organize fundraisers on and off anything official.<br><br>all that matters</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1660385943834984451","display_date":"May 21, 2023 · 20:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
