{"id":"twitter:1659718672087220225","tweet_id":"1659718672087220225","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1659718672087220225","title":"@ThomasHoufek @SamMorter Just explaining background knowledge. I try to define acronyms for International Audiences to be polite. Just saw bunch of fl","summary":"@ThomasHoufek @SamMorter Just explaining background knowledge. I try to define acronyms for International Audiences to be polite. Just saw bunch of flags and realized I said DCSA and FSP. I don't like to use acronyms without a full name antecedent.","date":"2023-05-20","published":"2023-05-20T00:32:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ThomasHoufek/status/1659717863203012609","reply_tweet_id":"1659717863203012609","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ThomasHoufek @SamMorter Just explaining background knowledge. I try to define acronyms for International Audiences to be polite.<br><br>Just saw bunch of flags and realized I said DCSA and FSP. I don&#x27;t like to use acronyms without a full name antecedent.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1659718672087220225","display_date":"May 20, 2023 · 00:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
