{"id":"twitter:1659264250433478672","tweet_id":"1659264250433478672","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1659264250433478672","title":"@exileoftza \"Two other U.S. officials and a former Biden administration official confirmed that an extended freeze in fighting is one possibility for ","summary":"@exileoftza \"Two other U.S. officials and a former Biden administration official confirmed that an extended freeze in fighting is one possibility for which the U.S. is preparing.\" It is US Doctrine to game out all possibilities. Saying \"one possibility is like saying the sky is blue\"","date":"2023-05-18","published":"2023-05-18T18:26:39+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1659263894580281344","reply_tweet_id":"1659263894580281344","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@exileoftza &quot;Two other U.S. officials and a former Biden administration official confirmed that an extended freeze in fighting is one possibility for which the U.S. is preparing.&quot;<br><br>It is US Doctrine to game out all possibilities. Saying &quot;one possibility is like saying the sky is blue&quot;</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1659264250433478672","display_date":"May 18, 2023 · 18:26 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
