{"id":"twitter:1659002392690524160","tweet_id":"1659002392690524160","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1659002392690524160","title":"@StevenRWilson72 @T1M_WBM @neoclassic911 @WJBMass @R9Legacy @elonmusk @jimmy_dore They were written into law in 1996. You can read NATO report about t","summary":"@StevenRWilson72 @T1M_WBM @neoclassic911 @WJBMass @R9Legacy @elonmusk @jimmy_dore They were written into law in 1996. You can read NATO report about the labs every year. In 2015(ish) it was decided to add more biological, chemical, and nuclear clean up capabilities. That is because of Assad and Putin in Aleppo and all the Nuclear Reactors in a war zone https","date":"2023-05-18","published":"2023-05-18T01:06:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/StevenRWilson72/status/1659001424012009474","reply_tweet_id":"1659001424012009474","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@StevenRWilson72 @T1M_WBM @neoclassic911 @WJBMass @R9Legacy @elonmusk @jimmy_dore They were written into law in 1996.<br><br>You can read  NATO report about the labs every year.<br><br>In 2015(ish) it was decided to add more biological, chemical, and nuclear clean up capabilities.<br><br>That is because of Assad and Putin in Aleppo and all the Nuclear Reactors in a war zone <a href=\"https://t.co/hic3qCM7fh\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/hic3qCM7fh</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f48552d173e6328bc959333db412f3ba.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1659002392690524160","display_date":"May 18, 2023 · 01:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f48552d173e6328bc959333db412f3ba.jpg"]}
