{"id":"twitter:1655035314644066306","tweet_id":"1655035314644066306","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1655035314644066306","title":"@NAFO_Partizan @RenegadeCupid @StephenKing I want two simple solutions that will reduce the violence immensely. Be 21 to own, purchase, or be gifted a","summary":"@NAFO_Partizan @RenegadeCupid @StephenKing I want two simple solutions that will reduce the violence immensely. Be 21 to own, purchase, or be gifted a high capacity long rifle. A thirty day waiting period. If you look at almost all the mass shootings that resulted in school shootings in particular, this helps.","date":"2023-05-07","published":"2023-05-07T02:22:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/NAFO_Partizan/status/1655032737462382600","reply_tweet_id":"1655032737462382600","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@NAFO_Partizan @RenegadeCupid @StephenKing I want two simple solutions that will reduce the violence immensely.<br><br>Be 21 to own, purchase, or be gifted a high capacity long rifle.<br><br>A thirty day waiting period.<br><br>If you look at almost all the mass shootings that resulted in school shootings in particular, this helps.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1655035314644066306","display_date":"May 07, 2023 · 02:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
