{"id":"twitter:2080625609537941922","tweet_id":"2080625609537941922","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2080625609537941922","title":"@NathanMcNulty I always try to get companies to drop BYOD, but many of my customers still use it. Full MDM enrollment FIPS-approved OS and operating m","summary":"@NathanMcNulty I always try to get companies to drop BYOD, but many of my customers still use it. Full MDM enrollment FIPS-approved OS and operating model Secure Boot and TPM And authority for your org to inspect, seize, and wipe your device. That's the price you pay. Demand a device","date":"2026-07-24","published":"2026-07-24T12:06:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/NathanMcNulty/status/2080082972414521622","reply_tweet_id":"2080082972414521622","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@NathanMcNulty I always try to get companies to drop BYOD, but many of my customers still use it.<br><br>Full MDM enrollment<br>FIPS-approved OS and operating model<br>Secure Boot and TPM<br><br>And authority for your org to inspect, seize, and  wipe your device.<br><br>That&#x27;s the price you pay. Demand a device</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2080625609537941922","display_date":"July 24, 2026 · 12:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
