{"id":"twitter:1654290751856017408","tweet_id":"1654290751856017408","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1654290751856017408","title":"@spawnofKahn @MalcolmNance 2/ Search \"Pete\" or and \"Malcolm Nance\" Smears predate the full scale invasion of the war. It is a lot of the same accounts","summary":"@spawnofKahn @MalcolmNance 2/ Search \"Pete\" or and \"Malcolm Nance\" Smears predate the full scale invasion of the war. It is a lot of the same accounts often in 2a, maga, or other fake Patriot accounts. People who don't give a shit about Ukraine and just want to rage post. Clean clothes fight dumb.","date":"2023-05-05","published":"2023-05-05T01:03:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1654289816832319490","reply_tweet_id":"1654289816832319490","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@spawnofKahn @MalcolmNance 2/<br><br>Search &quot;Pete&quot; or  and &quot;Malcolm Nance&quot;<br><br>Smears predate the full scale invasion of the war.<br><br>It is a lot of the same accounts often in 2a, maga, or other fake Patriot accounts. People who don&#x27;t give a shit about Ukraine and just want to rage post.<br><br>Clean clothes fight dumb.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1654290751856017408","display_date":"May 05, 2023 · 01:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
