{"id":"twitter:1654245802007470081","tweet_id":"1654245802007470081","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1654245802007470081","title":"@Swagmiral @SirSchming @armyhaylenko @sunflowerglory @tweet4anna I was a forger. There is no need to verify as all fellas are in the Public Domain. Th","summary":"@Swagmiral @SirSchming @armyhaylenko @sunflowerglory @tweet4anna I was a forger. There is no need to verify as all fellas are in the Public Domain. They are thank you gifts from a volunteer But almost any forge has an email or Twitter link that can be verified. Are their fakes, yes. Of course They get bonked if spreading nonsense https://t.co/R2eW9mf5iD","date":"2023-05-04","published":"2023-05-04T22:05:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Swagmiral/status/1654244202677518337","reply_tweet_id":"1654244202677518337","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Swagmiral @SirSchming @armyhaylenko @sunflowerglory @tweet4anna I was a forger.<br><br>There is no need to verify as all fellas are in the Public Domain.<br><br>They are thank you gifts from a volunteer <br><br>But almost any forge has an email or Twitter link that can be verified.<br><br>Are their fakes, yes.<br><br>Of course<br><br>They get bonked if spreading nonsense <a href=\"https://t.co/R2eW9mf5iD\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/R2eW9mf5iD</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/753c61d6f9a4649d3f6d3074c603c6b0.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1654245802007470081","display_date":"May 04, 2023 · 22:05 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/753c61d6f9a4649d3f6d3074c603c6b0.jpg"]}
