{"id":"twitter:1653230658909618181","tweet_id":"1653230658909618181","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1653230658909618181","title":"@k_sonin @empathicchrist1 @Gerashchenko_en The Fake Rage Against the War machine rallies don't count. The Libertarian Party doesn't count. The Codepin","summary":"@k_sonin @empathicchrist1 @Gerashchenko_en The Fake Rage Against the War machine rallies don't count. The Libertarian Party doesn't count. The Codepink rallies don't count. There have been zero Z parties or antiwar protests in America that Russia did not organize.","date":"2023-05-02","published":"2023-05-02T02:51:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/k_sonin/status/1653033322258513921","reply_tweet_id":"1653033322258513921","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@k_sonin @empathicchrist1 @Gerashchenko_en The Fake Rage Against the War machine rallies don&#x27;t count.<br><br>The Libertarian Party doesn&#x27;t count. <br><br>The Codepink rallies don&#x27;t count.<br><br>There have been zero Z parties or antiwar protests in America that Russia did not organize.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1653230658909618181","display_date":"May 02, 2023 · 02:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1653230234064257024","tweet_id":"1653230234064257024","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1653230234064257024","title":"@Gerashchenko_en I have never met people who have wanted to see the Kremlin burn more than people who used to live in Russia. It's just different. You","summary":"@Gerashchenko_en I have never met people who have wanted to see the Kremlin burn more than people who used to live in Russia. It's just different. You don't get an ex-pat pride.... But a strong hatred. There aren't pro Russian rallies in any Expat community in America.","date":"2023-05-02","published":"2023-05-02T02:49:37+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Gerashchenko_en/status/1652969480002101250","reply_tweet_id":"1652969480002101250","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Gerashchenko_en I have never met people who have wanted to see the Kremlin burn more than people who used to live in Russia.<br><br>It&#x27;s just different. You don&#x27;t get an ex-pat pride.... But a strong hatred.<br><br>There aren&#x27;t pro Russian rallies in any Expat community in America.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1653230234064257024","display_date":"May 02, 2023 · 02:49 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
